{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object visible, approach & grab it, check properties, move to destination. Else, scan area. If still nothing, perform specific task.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ObjectPropertiesTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
